# Build context hygiene for every image in this repository.
#
# The Flask image runs `flask --app run db upgrade` at build time and copies its
# service directory wholesale. A SQLite file left behind in a working checkout
# (pib_api/flask/pibdata.db, gitignored) travelled into the image and made that
# upgrade fail with "table assistant_model already exists" - green in CI, red on
# every machine that had ever run the app (measured on the robot).
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3

# Local test environment and artefacts: a .test-venv is hundreds of megabytes and
# must never be part of a build context.
.test-venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
tests/results/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc

# Repository metadata and local editor state.
.git/
.gitignore
.dockerignore
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
